{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1453418-timelords","id":1453418,"title":"Timelords?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-06-24T17:32:10-07:00","id":1453418,"title":"Timelords?","content":"Highlander style immortals have been done, excellently, for WoD. The material is pretty easy to find. Call me crazy but I remember sometime back someone doing the Timelords (Doctor Who) for WoD, specifically Mage. I've gone search for it and can't find it. Am I remembering correctly or am in in Quiet? Help?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26915-tstone","name":"tstone","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-24T20:06:39-07:00","id":1453429,"title":"","content":"The Timelords were written up. But B.J. Zanzibar is long gone. I'd basically do Timelords as a Sons of Ether/Order of Hermes crossover that only do Wonder Spheres and a little Telepathy as Mind Sphere with a Psionic focus. <br /> <br /> Make Tadises Horzon Realms with the central power source being a Level five Nexus. The Tardises act as phalacteries and absorb paradox caused by limited travel into the past. Interfering with history gets you paradox hard. Preserving history by fighting off nasty Umbroods (aliens) gets your paradox reduced. Note: The Cybermen are clearly some of those ItX Null threat types. Transhumanity has invaded the past several times too. Daleks, being beings of rigidity and stasis are clearly Wyrm corrupted Weaver drones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-25T05:11:08-07:00","id":1453441,"title":"","content":"B J Zanzibar. Now that's a name I have not heard in a long, long time.<br /> <br /> I think if you want anything from there you are better off building it from scratch. What would you want to do with them?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-25T05:50:48-07:00","id":1453443,"title":"","content":"Who\u2019s B.J. Zanzibar?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-25T06:51:02-07:00","id":1453449,"title":"","content":"Back in the '90s, when the internet was just becoming a public thing, B.J. Zanzibar was a person who set up a website featuring fan created material for the World of Darkness. As Astromancer pointed out, the site is long gone now. But it was popular in its day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\